<details class="report-details report-appendix" data-motion-state="entered"><summary><span class="data-copy">CHANEL: LONGER FINANCIAL HISTORY</span><span class="data-copy">FY2020–FY2025</span></summary>
<p>The pandemic shock and rebound frame the later slowdown. Free cash flow fell from $3,755m in FY2023 to $1,842m in FY2024, then rose to $2,646m in FY2025. These longer series provide context for the FY2023 baseline used in the main analysis.</p>
          
          
          <p class="report-note">USD millions. FY2023–FY2025 revenue and operating profit use exact filed-account inputs; older values and investment ratios retain the original disclosure precision. FY2020 operating profit and capex use the restated FY2021 comparative. Operating margin is derived.</p>
          
          <div class="report-data-dashboard report-data-dashboard--summary" >
            <div class="report-dashboard__heading">
              <span class="data-copy">CHANEL / FY2025 SNAPSHOT</span>
              <span class="data-copy">SELECTED SIGNALS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="report-kpi-grid">
              <article class="report-kpi-card">
                <span class="data-copy">REVENUE</span>
                <strong>${financial2025.revenue.toLocaleString('en-US')}m</strong>
                <em class="data-copy">+3% REPORTED</em>
              </article>
              <article class="report-kpi-card">
                <span class="data-copy">OPERATING PROFIT</span>
                <strong>${financial2025.profit.toLocaleString('en-US')}m</strong>
                <em class="data-copy">+5.2% VS FY2024</em>
              </article>
              <article class="report-kpi-card">
                <span class="data-copy">OPERATING MARGIN</span>
                <strong>{financial2025.margin.toFixed(1)}%</strong>
                <em class="data-copy">DERIVED</em>
              </article>
              <article class="report-kpi-card">
                <span class="data-copy">FREE CASH FLOW</span>
                <strong>${financial2025.fcf.toLocaleString('en-US')}m</strong>
                <em class="data-copy">+43.6% VS FY2024</em>
              </article>
            </div>
          </div>
          <details class="report-details">
            <summary><span class="data-copy">SHOW FULL DATA TABLE</span><span class="data-copy">6 YEARS / 7 METRICS</span></summary>
