            <div class="report-visual__heading">
              <span class="data-copy">APPENDIX / BUSINESS TRAJECTORY</span>
              <span class="data-copy">HOVER / CLICK TO INSPECT</span>
            </div>
            <div class="report-business-chart">
              <div class="report-business-chart__years data-copy"><span>2020</span><span>2021</span><span>2022</span><span>2023</span><span>2024</span><span>2025</span></div>
              {businessChart.map((metric) => (
                <div class="report-business-row">
                  <div class="report-business-row__label">
                    <strong class="data-copy">{metric.label}</strong>
                    <span class="data-copy">{metric.unit}</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="report-business-row__bars">
                    {metric.values.map((value, index) => (
                      <button type="button" class="report-business-bar" data-chart-bar data-series={metric.label.toLowerCase()} data-year={String(2020 + index)} aria-label={`${metric.label} ${2020 + index}: ${metric.unit === '%' ? `${value}%` : value.toLocaleString('en-US')}`} aria-pressed="false" style={`--bar-height:${(value / metric.max) * 100}%;`}>
                        <b>{metric.unit === '%' ? `${value}%` : value.toLocaleString('en-US')}</b>
                      </button>
                    ))}
                  </div>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
          
          
          
          
          <p>In FY2025, capital expenditure was $1,449m and brand-support investment was $2,395m. The longer table preserves their intensity alongside cash generation. Brand support covers the group; it is not a handbag advertising budget.</p>
          
          
          
